{"id":"W124aece7790b805429b0a64f","zh":"最大Z振级","en":"","name":"最大Z振级","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W124aece7790b805429b0a64f","text":"最大Z振级","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S174fceb71b1ec354a622","source_id":"P137","page":8,"page_end":8,"language":"zh","text":"这是由于阻尼增加,使隧道壁振幅的叠加减小,同时也使隧道壁振动的持续时间减小,故使得隧道壁最大Z振级随板下阻尼呈现非线性变化规律。","citations":[{"source_id":"P137","page":8,"page_end":8}]},{"id":"S414852c57a40a5df4d41","source_id":"P137","page":9,"page_end":9,"language":"zh","text":"当扣件刚度和板下刚度一定时,最大Z振级随板厚的增大大多呈现先增大后减小的变化规律,仅在扣件刚度为70 kN/mm且板下刚度大于0.025 N/mm3时呈现逐步递增规律,板厚为350 mm的浮置板下的隧道壁最大Z 振级普遍比250 mm 和450 mm 的板厚大。","citations":[{"source_id":"P137","page":9,"page_end":9}]}],"sources":{"P077":{"id":"P077","title":"Matrix formulation of the wheel-rail contact element in train-track dynamic analysis","authors":"Lei Xu","year":"2025","doi":"10.1016/j.apm.2024.115874","journal_citation":"Applied Mathematical Modelling 140, 115874","label":"Xu（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-matrix-formulation-of-the-wheel-rail-contact-element-in-train-track-dynamic-analysis"},"P137":{"id":"P137","title":"考虑权重系数的浮置板系统多参数影响与匹配分析","authors":"陈宪麦,黄厚龙,徐磊,胡逸宁,仵雷振,邓燚","year":"2025","doi":"10.11817/j.issn.1672-7207.2025.01.029","journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"陈宪麦等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-analysis-of-multi-parameter-influence-and-matching-in-floating-plate-system-considering-weight-coeff"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"本文评价隧道壁垂向振动的核心指标，其计算频段为1～80 Hz。","language":"zh","source_id":"P137","paper_slug":"2025-analysis-of-multi-parameter-influence-and-matching-in-floating-plate-system-considering-weight-coeff","title":"考虑权重系数的浮置板系统多参数影响与匹